# Python virtualenvs (left over from an earlier layout)
venv/

# Notes on what is deliberately NOT ignored:
#
#   css/app.css   Generated from scss/app.scss, but committed on purpose so the
#                 site can be served without running the SCSS build. If you
#                 later move the build into CI, ignore it here instead.
#
#   yarn.lock     Committed on purpose for reproducible installs. The previous
#                 .gitignore listed it (plus a typo line, "css!/yarn.lock")
#                 while the file was tracked anyway, which only caused
#                 confusion. Pick one lockfile and keep it tracked.
